    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ship goes brrr is a highscore-chaser with idle and rougelite elements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Planet to 64</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPilot a ship through alien terrain collecting crystals and avoiding hazards as you rack up a high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But does it go brrr?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the credits you earn at the end of each run to unlock upgrades for future runs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/extras/5086a8d1a3a69ac6e01885726f6011f6.poster.avif?t=1752383222\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/extras/5086a8d1a3a69ac6e01885726f6011f6.webm?t=1752383222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/extras/5086a8d1a3a69ac6e01885726f6011f6.mp4?t=1752383222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An idle game that fights back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the crescendo of storms on Planet 64 that drain your score and consume your crystals. Pick your upgrades carefully to ensure you bounce back after each storm and are ready for the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless* gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ship features &amp; additional zones in the upgrade shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure your spot on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<i>gameplay will end suddenly for most players</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ship goes brrr is a highscore-chaser with idle and rougelite elements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Planet to 64</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPilot a ship through alien terrain collecting crystals and avoiding hazards as you rack up a high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But does it go brrr?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the credits you earn at the end of each run to unlock upgrades for future runs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/extras/5086a8d1a3a69ac6e01885726f6011f6.poster.avif?t=1752383222\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/extras/5086a8d1a3a69ac6e01885726f6011f6.webm?t=1752383222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/extras/5086a8d1a3a69ac6e01885726f6011f6.mp4?t=1752383222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An idle game that fights back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the crescendo of storms on Planet 64 that drain your score and consume your crystals. Pick your upgrades carefully to ensure you bounce back after each storm and are ready for the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless* gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ship features &amp; additional zones in the upgrade shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure your spot on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<i>gameplay will end suddenly for most players</i></p>",
